      "updated": 0,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Blue containers are planned; green is built and tested today. Client alert rules, hooks and the checkpoint manager live in the trainer process and are built; sync and the server are planned (the first server step, read-only, is designed in ADR-0011).",
